### 新增一名学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json    ###这是请求头，下面的是请求体，请求头和请求体之间必须用一行空行分开

{
  "name": "Eve",
  "age": 24,
  "classId": 2
}


### 更新学生信息
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "TomUpdated",
  "age": 20,
  "classId": 1
}



### 为了测试删除功能，先创建一条待删除的测试记录
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "DeleteTest",
  "age": 99,
  "classId": 1
}


### 删除刚才创建的测试学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/7


### 查询功能也可以放在http文档里，不一定要放到浏览器里，当然，增删改也可以放到浏览器里，例如，用http文档来查询全部学生：
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### 查询 ID 为 1 的学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/11


### 测试A：合法新增，预期成功
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace",
  "age": 26,
  "classId": 1
}


### 测试B：非法新增，年龄小于1
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ValidationAgeFail",
  "age": -10,
  "classId": 1
}



### 测试：拒绝非法更新
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 10,
  "name": "Eve",
  "age": -10,
  "classId": 2
}




### 按姓名模糊查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search?name=Grace



### 查询不存在的姓名
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search?name=NobodyExists




### 分页查询：第1页，每页5条
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&size=5

### 分页查询：第2页，每页5条
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=2&size=5




### 测试1：页码为0
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=0&size=5

### 测试2：每页数量为0
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&size=0

### 测试3：每页数量超过限制
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&size=10000




### 第1页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&size=5

### 第2页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=2&size=5

### 超出总页数
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=3&size=5




### 按姓名查询并分页：第1页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/page?name=Bob&page=1&size=1

### 按姓名查询并分页：第2页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/page?name=Bob&page=2&size=1

### 查询不存在的姓名
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/page?name=NobodyExists&page=1&size=5





### 普通分页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&size=5

### 姓名模糊查询分页
GET http://localhost:8080/students/search/page?name=Bob&page=1&size=1





### 测试：更新不存在的学生
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9999,
  "name": "TestStudent",
  "age": 20,
  "classId": 1
}

### 测试：删除不存在的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/9999



### 查询不存在的学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/9999

###
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1



### 查询学生及其班级名称
GET http://localhost:8080/students/with-class




### 查询通信1班及其学生
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1/students

### 查询通信2班及其学生
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/2/students

### 测试不存在的班级
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/9999/students




### 1. 将学生1转到班级2
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1/class
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 2
}

### 2. 测试目标班级不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1/class
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 9999
}

### 3. 测试学生不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/9999/class
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 2
}

### 4. 测试非法班级ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1/class
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": 0
}




### 查看学生1的新班级
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

### 查看班级2的学生列表
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/2/students

### 查看班级1的学生列表
GET http://localhost:8080/classes/1/students




### 故意制造中途失败：最后一个学生不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/classes/1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentIds": [1, 2, 9999]
}




### 成功：将学生1和学生2转到班级1
PUT http://localhost:8080/classes/1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentIds": [1, 2]
}






